    that needs the larger potential difference (correct) \xB7 B. The smaller \xB7
    C. Both the same. Right: AQ_GOOD. Wrong: S13_AQ2_FB/_FC, hint S13_AQ2_H, retry;
    out of tries: S13_AQ2_X. Panel 640 px docked right."
